{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":139,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 139:1"},"O LORD, thou hast searched me, and known ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["me."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 139:2"},"Thou knowest my downsitting and mine uprising, thou understandest my thought afar off. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 139:3"},"Thou compassest my path and my lying down, and art acquainted ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with "]},"all my ways. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 139:4"},"For ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," not a word in my tongue, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but,"]}," lo, O LORD, thou knowest it altogether. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 139:5"},"Thou hast beset me behind and before, and laid thine hand upon me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 139:6"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Such"]}," knowledge ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," too wonderful for me; it is high, I cannot ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["attain"]}," unto it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 139:7"},"Whither shall I go from thy spirit? or whither shall I flee from thy presence? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 139:8"},"If I ascend up into heaven, thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," there: if I make my bed in hell, behold, thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art there."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 139:9"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["If"]}," I take the wings of the morning, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," dwell in the uttermost parts of the sea; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 139:10"},"Even there shall thy hand lead me, and thy right hand shall hold me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 139:11"},"If I say, Surely the darkness shall cover me; even the night shall be light about me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 139:12"},"Yea, the darkness hideth not from thee; but the night shineth as the day: the darkness and the light ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," both alike ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to thee. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 139:13"},"For thou hast possessed my reins: thou hast covered me in my mother’s womb. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 139:14"},"I will praise thee; for I am fearfully ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," wonderfully made: marvellous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," thy works; and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," my soul knoweth right well. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 139:15"},"My substance was not hid from thee, when I was made in secret, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," curiously wrought in the lowest parts of the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 139:16"},"Thine eyes did see my substance, yet being unperfect; and in thy book all ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my members"]}," were written, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," in continuance were fashioned, when ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as yet there was"]}," none of them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 139:17"},"How precious also are thy thoughts unto me, O God! how great is the sum of them! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 139:18"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["If"]}," I should count them, they are more in number than the sand: when I awake, I am still with thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 139:19"},"Surely thou wilt slay the wicked, O God: depart from me therefore, ye bloody men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 139:20"},"For they speak against thee wickedly, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," thine enemies take ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thy name"]}," in vain. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 139:21"},"Do not I hate them, O LORD, that hate thee? and am not I grieved with those that rise up against thee? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 139:22"},"I hate them with perfect hatred: I count them mine enemies. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 139:23"},"Search me, O God, and know my heart: try me, and know my thoughts: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:23"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PSA 139:24"},"And see if ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there be any"]}," wicked way in me, and lead me in the way everlasting. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 139:24"}]}]}
